"""Scene plan for the ADHD Dewasa reel: one entry per scene, anchored to a caption phrase.

p      = index of the caption phrase (captions.txt line order) the scene cuts on
kind   = 'img'  -> Z Image keyframe, animated locally (camera move + parallax + graphics)
         'vid'  -> keyframe animated by Seedance 2.0 Mini (image-to-video)
cam    = local camera move applied to the plate: pushin | pullout | panl | panr | rise | drift
gfx    = motion-graphic layer (see compositions builder)
tr     = transition INTO this scene
Generated by build_project.py into storyboard.md and the HyperFrames compositions.
"""

